<title>INDIA: India National Stock exchange revises market hours.</title>
<headline>India National Stock exchange revises market hours.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Stock Exchange (NSE) said it has revised trading hours from Wednesday due to satellite problems.</p>
<p>Trading time from Wednesday has been set from 9.30 a.m. (0400 GMT) to 3.00 p.m. (0930 GMT), the NSE said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new timings will remain in effect until further notice, the exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
